      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICKY'S FURY (4) goes very well over this track and trip including two wins. Missed the frame latest (26.03) when fifth over 450m at Ballarat in a Mix 6/7. Rates on top and should go close. ONE MORE DRAM (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 25.70 beating Creativity. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Must be included in calculations. ROCKET TATTOO (7) was below best last time when sixth at Bendigo but prior to that was a T3 RSTW winner in the quickest time on the card at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. ROYCE VAN WINKLE (6) won as expected last time and is sure to feature again.",
